  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Mario Bros.

    Release year: 1983


    Not to be confused with the
    ever-iconic platformer Super Mario Bros, the original Mario Bros saw Mario and
    Luigi attempting to take out hoards of Shellcreepers, Sidesteppers, and Fighterflies.


    Also
    seen in later games, the POW-Block first debuted in the original Mario Bros -
    this makes it even older than the Goomba and Koopa Troopa, which only debuted
    two years later in Super Mario Bros!


    In Mario Bros, the POW-Block would
    damage all enemies standing on the ground. Here, it''ll damage all enemies in
    a radius - because we don''t have a ground!'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 390c06d404a51b047afaaca45f7c13c6, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -6740465015241546099, guid: 390c06d404a51b047afaaca45f7c13c6, type: 2}
