  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Space Invaders

    Release year: 1978


    In Space Invaders, the player
    fends off against a hoard of alien invaders by controlling a cannon and hiding
    behind bunkers.


    Fun Fact: Space Invaders is one of the first instances
    of the idea that "It''s not a bug, it''s a surprise feature!"


    Due to hardware
    limitations of the time, the large number of enemies slowed down the game - which
    inversely meant that as the player got close to finishing off the aliens, they
    got faster! This was left in the final release and served as a way to dynamically
    make the enemies harder as the player grew closer to success.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 390c06d404a51b047afaaca45f7c13c6, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -6740465015241546099, guid: 390c06d404a51b047afaaca45f7c13c6, type: 2}
